	<key>readme</key>
	<string>## Usage
- `gh &lt;query&gt;`: filter repositories as you type. ⏎ opens the repository
  - ⌘⏎ Pull Requests / ⌥⏎ Issues / ⌃⏎ Actions / ⇧⏎ copy SSH clone URL
- `ghr`: refresh the cached repository list now

## Requirements
- GitHub CLI (`gh`) installed and logged in with `gh auth login`

The list covers every repository returned by `gh api user/repos` (your own, collaborator and organization repos). It refreshes in the background once older than the Cache TTL.

Details: https://github.com/obiyuta/alfred-github-repo-jump</string>
